        "slc_eb6cc94d26a23193eba2f74c8a5f01d5ef3da76e1c3fd095257af3342833796d"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture is a pure kernel (`createCore()`) providing EventBus, HandlerRegistry, Compositor, multi-backend coordination, and a default cwd handler, with agent, shell, TUI, and providers all loaded as extensions."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
