      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0b4105d9bd1fd64d0973021cfd6734dfd0573ef515d78be641b9ecc5bf7753af"
      ],
      "text": "The default backend `ash` resolves providers, configures an LlmClient, calls any OpenAI-compatible API directly, and executes tools in a loop until the LLM finishes; it only activates once an apiKey and model are resolved."
    },
