        "slc_43b7714b75463ef2d331400bec48a725da14189851eb209f576fad8091db9ae0"
      ],
      "text": "The agent runs a tool loop with no hard iteration limit; side-effect-free tools run in parallel via Promise.all while side-effecting tools run sequentially, and results over maxResultBytes (default 100KB) are head+tail truncated."
    },
